{"reviews":[{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-0","r":2.0,"t":"Uneven teeth... see photo","x":"This comb is made of a nice material that feels good. Unfortunately, when it arrived the teeth of the comb were incredibly uneven on both sides, fine and coarse. I was hoping this would resolve over time, but it has not. It's still sufficiently functional to not make me not want to go through the hassle of returning it, but I do feel a bit unsatisfied since I can use only part of the comb. At least it smells nice.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-1","r":5.0,"t":"Recommend this bad mamajamma.","x":"Dude... It's a chunk of wood that you use to groom your face. Buy it.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-2","r":4.0,"t":"Perfectly manly smelling and portable.....but fragile (DON'T DROP IT)!!!","x":"Wow...my first wood comb. This is soooo much more comfortable to use than the plastic combs I had been using on my beard. And the scent is just perfectly woodsy!!! I have been walking around the house with it...combing my beard and not once has any hair been pulled out. This is what I should have had months ago... It fits perfectly in my pocket and leaves my handkerchief smelling woodsy sandalwoody...I love it!!  Update: Be careful not to drop the comb. I had the misfortune of dropping it from a","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-3","r":5.0,"t":"Great for unruly facial hair","x":"This is the perfect comb for my crazy mustache and beard. It tames the random hairs that don't want to cooperate due to the non static properties of this beautiful solid wooden comb. I also ha e no reservations about keeping it In my pocket due to the quality craftsmanship of the piece.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-4","r":5.0,"t":"A Somewhat Stinky Five Stars","x":"First beard comb for my first beard. I'm not a fan of the smell so much but I read the reviews and was prepared for some kind of smell so I'm not going to take off for that but it does have a heavy scent out of the box though it's reduced somewhat over the last several days. Very comfortable and I find myself combing my beard even when it doesn't need it. Nice quality at a good price.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-5","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful! Used Daily!","x":"I love this comb. I use it every day. I think it smells amazing. I use it with beard oil and I like how the wood retains the oil and how the oil mixes with the scent of the wood. Amazing quality for the price! I couldn't be happier honestly. I don't see this ever breaking, but if for some odd reason it did break, I would buy another one for sure!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-6","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"This is sturdy as hell. Smells AMAZING while brushing and taming the beast on my chin. 5/5 and recommend!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-7","r":1.0,"t":"It smells and doesn't work","x":"It literally stinks it hurts to comb with and do not recommend it to anyone","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-8","r":5.0,"t":"Better than lingerie: A perfect  \"just for him\" gift!","x":"Bought this for my husband for Christmas, he LOVES it.  He has a lot of facial hair and doesn't put much effort into extra grooming routines, but he often complained that his beard &#34;itched&#34; in the winter.  Having never grown a beard myself, I looked to fellow Amazon customers to point me to a solution.  Paired this puppy up with Grave Before Shave. &#34;bourbon&#34; beard oil, and the scent of the sandalwood complements it very well: spicy, slightly sweet, and warm.  Hubby never wears co","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-9","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect choice for my first \"specialty\" comb.","x":"Bought this as my &#34;first beard comb&#34;.  The pictures don't do it justice, the grain on this comb really pops out, especially in the sunlight.  It looks sleek and is small enough to carry in your pocket (which I don't recommend since it seems like the fine teeth can snap easily).  The teeth are spaced evenly on both sides and the comb is wide enough to cover a good chunk of beard.  It smells good too.  If you purchase this, make sure to get a good smell right out of the box.  Earthy and co","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-10","r":5.0,"t":"Packaging and shipping time were great. It is not only good for beards but ...","x":"Packaging and shipping time were great.  It is not only good for beards but makes a great hair comb since it is gripped with the whole palm and not just fingertips.  Has a great smell and really nice feel.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great Comb","x":"Bought a second comb for a gift.  This comb performs just as advertised, I like the feel (real wood) and it gets every hair of my nappy beard.  after over a month using it I'll recommend..","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-12","r":5.0,"t":"Best beard and mustache cob I've had in a while","x":"Best beard and mustache cob I've had in a while. Unlike a lot of other sandlewood combs, this one had no warped teeth or cracks in the main body. GREAT comb and even better price!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-13","r":2.0,"t":"Teeth are a bit sharp.","x":"Works ok, but the ends of the comb teeth are a bit sharp compared to the Huntsman comb I also purchased. Perhaps the teeth will become less sharp over time.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-14","r":5.0,"t":"Happy","x":"My husband LOVES this comb the only complaint I had was that since he travels a lot the Columbia warped I think from the moister and change in heat/cold.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great comb for the money","x":"Great comb for the money. I bought another brand after buying this one and I regretted it.  The only thing missing would be a carrying case.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-16","r":5.0,"t":"Great product to have when you grow a beard","x":"Great product to have when you grow a beard. The material feels good and is sturdy enough to get rid of any stuck hairs together.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-17","r":5.0,"t":"Good comb","x":"Use this a beard comb and it works great. Note that it has a VERY strong smell for a comb, but thankfully I find it pleasant.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-18","r":5.0,"t":"Great, durable wooden comb for the money.","x":"This comb is actually very sturdy and works well. It has a great scent to it and I believe it will last me awhile.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-19","r":5.0,"t":"Great gift.","x":"My husband loves this. He thought I was joking when I gave it to him but now he uses it everyday.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-20","r":5.0,"t":"New pocket requirement.","x":"Love the comb. It also smells delightful and leaves just a hint behind after grooving.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-21","r":5.0,"t":"built from solid wood","x":"Works very well.  Easy to handle and use daily.  Solidly built from solid wood.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-22","r":5.0,"t":"Should have bought sooner!","x":"High quality, WONDERFUL smelling comb!!!  Highly reccommended!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-23","r":1.0,"t":"Full of mold, eww!","x":"Arrived today fully covered in mold!  Sent back immediately.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01GCEQTA2-24","r":5.0,"t":"Nice comb. Good quality","x":"Good weight and well made. Excellent purchase.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the comb comfortable to use and effective at taming beard and mustache hair, often preferring it to plastic combs.","cites":[3,4,6,7,12]},{"text":"The wood scent is a common theme, with several reviewers loving it while a few find it strong or unpleasant.","cites":[3,5,6,7,8,11]},{"text":"Some reviewers report durability concerns, noting the comb is fragile, can warp, or has teeth that may snap.","cites":[3,10,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention issues with the teeth being uneven or sharp.","cites":[1,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers praise the quality and craftsmanship relative to the price, and some bought it as a gift.","cites":[4,6,9,12,13]}]},"qa":[]}